  <p id="c-nanshi-023-wangxuan-eldest-son:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangxuan-eldest-son:p001:m0000" ref="1tc_q18_x7v">景文</persName>曰：「知卿至心；若見念者，為我百口計。」乃墨啟答敕，並謝贈詔。酌謂客曰：「此酒不可相勸。」自仰而飲之。時年六十。追贈開府儀同三司，諡曰懿。長子<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangxuan-eldest-son:p001:m0073" ref="1tc_q18_x7v_A">絢</persName>。</p>
</text>
